# stage0.files — mkinitfs feature: bake the stage0 apkovl into the initramfs
# (stage0-netboot-image).
#
# The stage0 payload (scripts, config, reinstall bundle, stage1 sources, and the
# local.d boot hook) is packaged by build-initramfs.sh as a single apkovl
# (tar.gz) at /stage0.apkovl.tar.gz. initramfs-init extracts it into the live
# root before switch_root (via `apkovl=/stage0.apkovl.tar.gz` on the cmdline),
# so the payload survives into the booted system and local.d runs the menu.
#
# The tool binaries (dialog, parted, sfdisk, grub, dropbear, httpd, setup-disk,
# patch) are installed from the apk repo via the `pkgs=` cmdline instead of
# being baked here — anything baked only into the initramfs is lost on
# switch_root, and apk resolves their library dependencies.
/stage0.apkovl.tar.gz
